# Local-only configuration for SLNews Mobile. Never commit this file.
#
# The build scripts and `scripts/smoke_api.ps1` read it when present; every value
# is also accepted as a --dart-define / environment variable, which is how CI
# and the release build should supply them.

# --- SLNews scraper API (content) -------------------------------------------
# Public base URL of the deployed service. The default in code is the Render
# host below, so this only needs changing for a self-hosted or local instance.
SLNEWS_API_URL=https://slnewsapiscapper.onrender.com

# OPTIONAL static bearer key for /v1/news and /api/news. Leave it empty for the
# release profile: the scraper also accepts a Clerk session token, so a signed-in
# reader authenticates without any secret embedded in the APK. The source is
# enabled when this key OR an identity (CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY below) is present;
# with neither it skips the API and serves RSS + bundled seed content. For a keyed
# demo build, the live value is Render's API_KEY environment variable - not here.
SLNEWS_API_KEY=

# Optional page size (1-100) for the scraper API.
SLNEWS_API_PAGE_SIZE=20

# --- Clerk (identity) --------------------------------------------------------
# Publishable key of the SLNews Clerk application. Publishable keys are safe to
# ship in a client, but they are still kept out of source control so that dev
# and production instances do not get mixed up.
CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
